abstract: >-
  Pipeline that computes, for candidate crystals from the Materials Project, the off-Bragg thermal-neutron
  transmission (NCrystal with DFT and machine-learned phonons), the reference thickness and the fast-neutron and
  photon rejection at that thickness (ENDF/B-VIII.0), with a model uncertainty from a benchmark against measured
  EXFOR total cross-sections. It ranks the candidates on fronts with Monte Carlo rank probabilities and adds slab
  transport, orientation, temperature and practicality data for a shortlist of grown crystals.
